\b Updated Edition -- What Has Changed\b0\par
\par
This installer contains an updated build of com0com with the following improvements over the original v3.0.0.0 release from 2012:\par
\par
\b Build System\b0\par
- Modernized for Visual Studio 2026 and Windows Driver Kit 10.0.26100\par
- MSBuild project files replace the obsolete DDK build system\par
- WiX MSI installer replaces the NSIS installer\par
\par
\b Driver Improvements\b0\par
- Default port settings updated to 8-N-1 at 9600 baud (was 7-E-1 at 1200)\par
- Fixed ACCESS_DENIED error on rapid port open/close cycles\par
- Kernel-mode signing certificate required (test signing mode supported)\par
\par
\b Tools\b0\par
- New C# setup GUI targeting .NET 10 (replaces C++/CLI version)\par
- setupc.exe console tool preserved for scripting and automation\par
\par
\b Testing\b0\par
- Comprehensive test suite: 263 tests across 4 test executables\par
- Null-modem data integrity verification including binary patterns\par
- Plugin validation for all 16 hub4com filters and drivers\par
